{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>They shall take it down.</b> As the Targum renders: ״יְפָרְקוּן״ — when they set out to journey in the wilderness from station to station, they would dismantle it from its erection and carry it to the place where the cloud would settle, and encamp there and re-erect it." "<b>And the stranger who draws near.</b> To their service — this." "<b>Shall be put to death.</b> By the hand of Heaven."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:08.795877621Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}